-{
-  "slug": "unreleased",
-  "title": "In development",
-  "summary": "Built candidates and open testing, clearly separated from live features.",
-  "body": "<h2 id=\"journal\">Adventure Journal &amp; Epic 0.5</h2><p>The eight journal quests and Wayfarer’s Oath charm have been built but are <strong>not installed on the server</strong>. The candidate uses three shared chapters followed by Guardian, Striker, Arcanist, Warden or Binder paths. These are not available rewards.</p><h2 id=\"combat\">Combat and item candidates</h2><p>Broader Monk and Beastlord fist-damage formulas and some existing tiered item corrections have a tested candidate but no recorded deployment. A frozen personal casting bar remains under investigation. The separate <a href=\"multiclass.html#earned-skills\">extra-class skill, trainer and offhand correction</a> is deployed; the reported player issue was confirmed resolved.</p>\n<h2 id=\"testing\">Ongoing checks for deployed features</h2><p>Broader equipment and class combinations, stats, regeneration, ability names and Bard movement/songs still need player checks. Those are acceptance checks for installed systems, not a claim that all of them are unreleased. See <a href=\"features.html\">Features</a> for the available systems.</p>\n",
-  "category": "Reference",
-  "status": "Not released",
-  "updated": "2026-10-16",
