-{
-  "slug": "travel",
-  "title": "Travel & instances",
-  "summary": "City routes, rings, spires, waypoints and private dungeon runs.",
-  "body": "<h2 id=\"travel\">Ten city routes with return books</h2><p>Speak to Merrin in the tunnel for ten city destinations. Return books bring you back to the shared hub.</p>\n<h2 id=\"druid-rings\">Druid Ring travel</h2><p>Khalure offers the currently available Classic Druid Rings. Some routes and client installations still need checks. Report silent travel or missing-world failures to the owner.</p>\n<h2 id=\"wizard-spires\">Wizard Spire travel</h2><p>Khaleid offers eight Classic Wizard Spire destinations from the tunnel travel area.</p>\n<h2 id=\"knowledge-bridge\">A Plane of Knowledge connection</h2><p>A dedicated travel connection keeps the Plane of Knowledge reachable alongside the tunnel’s city routes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"recall\">Nightcap Recall</h2><p>Make a hotkey for Ancient Attunement in the General abilities tab. It returns you to the tunnel with a five-second cast and ten-minute reuse, preserving your bind point and other home destinations.</p>\n<h2 id=\"waypoint-travel\">Travel to places you have discovered</h2><p>Find waypoint markers to unlock return destinations with the Waypoint Master. Discovering them all is a <a href=\"waypoints.html\">custom exploration quest</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"instances\">Private dungeon runs</h2><p>Instance Keepers offer Befallen, Unrest, High Keep, Najena, Cazic-Thule, Permafrost, and Nagafen’s Lair. Hail to enter or join your group leader; use <code>#instances</code> for open runs and timers. Runs last 12 hours. Resets ask for confirmation and discard that instance’s kills and progress. The small floating-eye Keeper is separate from the waypoint portal.</p>\n",
-  "category": "World",
-  "status": "Live testing",
-  "updated": "2026-10-16",
